1
00:00:03,400 --> 00:00:07,420
The radiance of the night shines through my window

2
00:00:07,170 --> 00:00:11,370
but the path to immortality is long.

3
00:00:11,600 --> 00:00:16,100
The Eight Views and Nine-Bend Streams are desolate.

4
00:00:15,850 --> 00:00:21,260
Living beings question the miseries of the world over a jar of wine.

5
00:00:22,280 --> 00:00:25,250
Forget about Nirvana and rebirth,

6
00:00:25,400 --> 00:00:28,500
I will break through the waves with my own flesh and blood.

7
00:00:28,250 --> 00:00:33,770
The heavens are vast, so what if I was born mediocre ?

8
00:00:34,720 --> 00:00:37,730
I stare at the Dao in my moments of madness

9
00:00:37,840 --> 00:00:40,730
as the storm rages just below.

10
00:00:40,880 --> 00:00:45,100
I've been thinking about life and death in my dreams.

11
00:00:44,850 --> 00:00:48,090
I've unsheathed my sword to ask the immortals

12
00:00:48,000 --> 00:00:50,940
why the world is a-changing.

13
00:00:50,710 --> 00:00:54,290
Heaven and earth reveals its poignant truths.

14
00:00:54,280 --> 00:00:57,460
Swallow the Four Seas and the Eight Wastelands,

15
00:00:57,210 --> 00:01:00,540
experience all the vicissitudes of life in an instant.

16
00:01:00,450 --> 00:01:03,420
I will defy the light in the sky

17
00:01:03,170 --> 00:01:06,860
to continue to write a new chapter for all things in the three realms of existence.

18
00:01:15,690 --> 00:01:19,300
Just a thought separates mortal from immortal.

19
00:01:19,210 --> 00:01:22,380
Transform your insignificant body into light.

20
00:01:22,290 --> 00:01:25,500
The hardships of the journey

21
00:01:25,370 --> 00:01:28,460
will temper this young man's heart.

22
00:01:28,210 --> 00:01:33,100
If I become a Renegade Immortal, will I hesitate to fight the heavens ?

23
00:01:39,600 --> 00:01:43,730
Renegade Immortal
Subtitles by Bonobosubs
https://discord.gg/Ceckd4pdVA

24
00:02:13,360 --> 00:02:14,850
What is this ?

25
00:02:29,760 --> 00:02:33,170
Heaven Defying Space
inside the Heaven Defying Bead

26
00:02:39,840 --> 00:02:42,960
Where... am I ?

27
00:02:42,720 --> 00:02:44,960
Finally...

28
00:02:46,040 --> 00:02:47,680
This day

29
00:02:48,120 --> 00:02:50,600
has arrived !

30
00:02:51,200 --> 00:02:54,650
Situ Nan's
Origin Soul

31
00:02:54,520 --> 00:02:57,080
My physical body was destroyed

32
00:02:56,840 --> 00:03:00,520
and my Origin Soul has been trapped in here for thousands of years !

33
00:03:00,280 --> 00:03:01,960
But now...

34
00:03:01,720 --> 00:03:04,800
I'll finally regain my freedom !

35
00:03:05,360 --> 00:03:06,080
You...

36
00:03:05,960 --> 00:03:07,680
Your fate

37
00:03:07,440 --> 00:03:09,960
is to become my new body !

38
00:03:27,440 --> 00:03:29,290
How is this possible ?!

39
00:03:44,320 --> 00:03:47,930
How long does this senior plan on trying ?

40
00:03:53,200 --> 00:03:54,560
A mortal...

41
00:03:55,880 --> 00:03:57,920
I waited thousands of years

42
00:03:57,680 --> 00:04:00,490
for a mortal like you to find me !

43
00:04:00,280 --> 00:04:03,050
I can't even possess you !

44
00:04:08,800 --> 00:04:12,010
The Heaven Defying Bead really chose someone

45
00:04:11,760 --> 00:04:13,560
with mediocre talent.

46
00:04:13,760 --> 00:04:16,210
If I wait for him to be able to take me out,

47
00:04:15,960 --> 00:04:18,610
planet Suzaku will already have returned to dust !

48
00:04:20,160 --> 00:04:21,890
Junior's name is Wang Lin.

49
00:04:21,800 --> 00:04:23,370
I want to become an Immortal.

50
00:04:23,160 --> 00:04:25,050
Why doesn't Senior help me to cultivate

51
00:04:24,800 --> 00:04:26,240
so I can help you to escape.

52
00:04:26,040 --> 00:04:28,680
Your talent is mediocre !

53
00:04:29,200 --> 00:04:30,480
Talent...

54
00:04:31,080 --> 00:04:32,200
Talent...

55
00:04:32,680 --> 00:04:34,450
I was born ordinary

56
00:04:34,400 --> 00:04:36,250
but I am not fated to stay ordinary !

57
00:04:36,000 --> 00:04:37,600
You don't know your limits.

58
00:04:38,280 --> 00:04:48,030
Note: Several days have passed, the sect thinks Wang Lin disappeared and made a suicide attempt after his failure.

59
00:04:40,040 --> 00:04:41,650
Tie Zhu !

60
00:04:41,520 --> 00:04:44,400
Where are you, Tie Zhu ?

61
00:04:51,760 --> 00:04:52,880
Tie Zhu !

62
00:04:53,560 --> 00:04:56,040
Why would you do something so foolish !?

63
00:04:55,840 --> 00:04:57,000
Wang Lin,

64
00:04:57,000 --> 00:04:59,560
the Sect Leader admires your perseverance

65
00:04:59,320 --> 00:05:02,520
and made an exception to accept you as an outer disciple.

66
00:05:07,880 --> 00:05:09,880
What ? Are you not willing ?

67
00:05:12,760 --> 00:05:15,080
Disciple Wang Lin will follow your teachings

68
00:05:14,840 --> 00:05:16,000
and cultivate diligently.

69
00:05:15,800 --> 00:05:18,240
Zhang Kuang, take him back to the sect.

70
00:05:18,080 --> 00:05:18,800
Sure.

71
00:05:20,560 --> 00:05:21,720
Let's go.

72
00:05:33,880 --> 00:05:35,000
Tie Zhu...

73
00:05:38,160 --> 00:05:38,880
Father,

74
00:05:39,040 --> 00:05:40,080
Tie Zhu...

75
00:05:39,840 --> 00:05:40,680
Mother...

76
00:05:42,240 --> 00:05:44,600
I won't disappoint you.

77
00:05:54,760 --> 00:05:56,040
In our sect

78
00:05:56,160 --> 00:05:57,800
the color of your robe

79
00:05:57,760 --> 00:05:59,920
represents your status.

80
00:06:00,320 --> 00:06:01,890
White is the highest

81
00:06:01,680 --> 00:06:04,400
followed by red and yellow.

82
00:06:04,160 --> 00:06:05,320
Senior Brother.

83
00:06:05,320 --> 00:06:08,250
Outer Disciples Work Hall
Heng Yue Sect

84
00:06:06,040 --> 00:06:07,450
Then...

85
00:06:07,360 --> 00:06:08,970
what rank are gray robes ?

86
00:06:08,800 --> 00:06:10,800
They're outer disciples,

87
00:06:10,560 --> 00:06:13,050
they aren't counted as inner sect disciples.

88
00:06:13,680 --> 00:06:15,200
Brother Zhang !

89
00:06:14,960 --> 00:06:17,170
What brings you here today ?

90
00:06:13,480 --> 00:06:15,330
Liu Shulang
Heng Yue Sect disciple
1st layer of Qi Condensation

91
00:06:19,480 --> 00:06:21,280
Stay safe Brother Zhang !

92
00:06:28,960 --> 00:06:30,800
Just follow my lead and bet big !

93
00:06:30,760 --> 00:06:31,920
Go, go, go !

94
00:06:32,360 --> 00:06:33,720
Again, again, again !

95
00:06:34,440 --> 00:06:35,480
Bet big !

96
00:06:35,280 --> 00:06:36,360
What ?

97
00:06:36,120 --> 00:06:38,890
Do you expect me to fetch your bedding for you ?

98
00:06:38,760 --> 00:06:39,650
Yes, yes, yes !

99
00:06:39,800 --> 00:06:41,520
I told you to bet big !

100
00:06:41,520 --> 00:06:42,440
Ouch !

101
00:06:44,200 --> 00:06:47,290
I heard you got in by attempting suicide.

102
00:06:47,160 --> 00:06:49,000
You've got some nerve, kid.

103
00:06:51,560 --> 00:06:52,680
This round I bet big !

104
00:06:52,680 --> 00:06:53,880
It's either big or small anyway !

105
00:06:53,840 --> 00:06:54,680
Senior Brother,

106
00:06:54,960 --> 00:06:56,080
where do I live ?

107
00:06:57,760 --> 00:06:59,280
It's just a place to sleep,

108
00:06:59,040 --> 00:07:00,200
don't overthink.

109
00:07:00,440 --> 00:07:01,200
Here.

110
00:07:03,040 --> 00:07:06,250
Zhang Hu
Heng Yue Sect outer disciple

111
00:07:03,760 --> 00:07:05,170
I'm Zhang Hu,

112
00:07:04,960 --> 00:07:06,890
ask me if you have any questions.

113
00:07:09,320 --> 00:07:10,680
Alright, hurry up !

114
00:07:10,760 --> 00:07:12,360
These are tomorrow's tasks.

115
00:07:13,320 --> 00:07:14,770
Finally, they're here !

116
00:07:15,160 --> 00:07:16,440
This one's mine !

117
00:07:19,040 --> 00:07:20,570
No switching !

118
00:07:20,760 --> 00:07:21,760
Yours is so easy,

119
00:07:21,520 --> 00:07:22,880
look at mine !

120
00:07:23,640 --> 00:07:24,880
Same rules as always,

121
00:07:25,160 --> 00:07:27,530
if you fail to finish the task in 7 days,

122
00:07:27,400 --> 00:07:29,160
I'll report to the Elders

123
00:07:28,920 --> 00:07:30,640
and you'll be expelled from the sect.

124
00:07:31,800 --> 00:07:33,200
Yes, Senior Brother.

125
00:07:34,360 --> 00:07:35,520
After I finish the task,

126
00:07:35,280 --> 00:07:36,640
can I cultivate ?

127
00:07:37,600 --> 00:07:38,800
Cultivate ?

128
00:07:39,560 --> 00:07:40,720
Cultivate..?

129
00:07:41,200 --> 00:07:43,040
You're better off sleeping.

130
00:07:42,800 --> 00:07:44,890
He really thinks he will finish early ?

131
00:07:50,160 --> 00:07:51,730
Senior Brother Zhang Hu,

132
00:07:51,760 --> 00:07:54,000
why was the red task the last one left ?

133
00:07:54,480 --> 00:07:56,690
Is fetching water that hard ?

134
00:07:57,120 --> 00:07:58,560
You'll find out tomorrow.

135
00:08:00,120 --> 00:08:03,570
Rear mountain of
the Heng Yue Sect

136
00:08:40,240 --> 00:08:41,320
It's alright,

137
00:08:41,720 --> 00:08:42,880
I still have 6 days.

138
00:08:43,440 --> 00:08:44,680
If I work harder,

139
00:08:44,440 --> 00:08:45,760
I can do it.

140
00:09:00,760 --> 00:09:03,410
Can it really heal injuries ?

141
00:09:31,760 --> 00:09:33,650
I feel so light.

142
00:09:33,760 --> 00:09:37,570
Even water the Heaven Defying Bead was soaked into has effects.

143
00:09:39,080 --> 00:09:43,800
Although the outer disciples have low status,

144
00:09:43,560 --> 00:09:47,480
they still roam these spiritual mountains all day.

145
00:09:47,240 --> 00:09:49,520
Who knows what treasures they might find ?

146
00:09:50,040 --> 00:09:53,120
It would be a waste to leave it to them.

147
00:09:53,680 --> 00:09:56,600
We should take it for ourselves.

148
00:09:56,360 --> 00:09:58,930
It's all for the Dao of immortality.

149
00:09:58,760 --> 00:10:02,170
Don’t worry, I'll give you any treasure they find.

150
00:10:11,280 --> 00:10:15,320
Dew is the essence of water, let’s try with it.

151
00:10:39,400 --> 00:10:42,360
The effect of dew is even better !

152
00:10:44,800 --> 00:10:46,400
Not bad.

153
00:10:46,160 --> 00:10:49,730
This kid actually upgraded the water element of the Heaven Defying Bead.

154
00:11:10,440 --> 00:11:12,640
It's only been 4 days

155
00:11:12,400 --> 00:11:14,320
and he's almost done ?

156
00:11:14,080 --> 00:11:16,770
This kid is definitely suspicious.

157
00:11:34,640 --> 00:11:36,130
What’s going on ?

158
00:11:38,240 --> 00:11:39,320
Senior Brother Liu...

159
00:11:39,800 --> 00:11:42,600
Where have you hidden your treasure ?

160
00:11:43,080 --> 00:11:44,720
What treasure ?

161
00:11:44,480 --> 00:11:46,280
I don’t understand what you mean.

162
00:11:47,120 --> 00:11:49,210
Don't you dare lie to me !

163
00:11:48,960 --> 00:11:50,280
Remember

164
00:11:50,040 --> 00:11:52,160
that as long as you’re in the Heng Yue Sect,

165
00:11:51,920 --> 00:11:53,720
you’ll be beneath me !

166
00:11:53,920 --> 00:11:56,120
Don't you dare hide treasures from me !

167
00:11:56,560 --> 00:11:57,270
Hmph!

168
00:12:02,880 --> 00:12:04,240
Wang Lin !

169
00:12:07,240 --> 00:12:09,680
You fool ! Why didn’t you fight back !?

170
00:12:10,680 --> 00:12:13,400
I remember everything he did to me.

171
00:12:14,040 --> 00:12:16,210
As long as I become an Immortal,

172
00:12:16,240 --> 00:12:17,360
I can wait.

173
00:12:17,320 --> 00:12:18,600
But I can’t wait !

174
00:12:18,800 --> 00:12:21,570
From now on, I’ll teach you cultivation.

175
00:12:22,160 --> 00:12:23,810
Why are you laughing ?

176
00:12:23,760 --> 00:12:25,000
It's nothing,

177
00:12:25,040 --> 00:12:27,920
I was worried Senior would abandon me for someone else.

178
00:12:29,000 --> 00:12:30,610
Do you think I don’t want to ?

179
00:12:30,360 --> 00:12:33,130
But the damn Heaven Defying Bead chose you !

180
00:12:34,240 --> 00:12:36,480
I’ll strengthen your Spirit Root first.

181
00:12:36,720 --> 00:12:40,520
How many clouds are there on the Heaven Defying Bead ?

182
00:12:40,640 --> 00:12:41,800
Nine.

183
00:12:41,960 --> 00:12:43,720
So one more is missing

184
00:12:43,480 --> 00:12:45,360
before you can start cultivating.

185
00:12:45,560 --> 00:12:48,170
The Heng Yue Sect’s spiritual energy is thin,

186
00:12:48,000 --> 00:12:49,770
but it's better than nothing.

187
00:12:49,560 --> 00:12:51,480
Keep collecting dew

188
00:12:51,880 --> 00:12:54,000
and upgrade the Heaven Defying Bead.

189
00:12:54,360 --> 00:12:55,400
Senior Situ,

190
00:12:56,040 --> 00:12:56,920
thank you.

191
00:12:58,690 --> 00:13:29,880
Note: Cultivation is born from real Daoism, Buddhism and Confucianism. It's internal alchemy. Instead of swallowing mercury to try to become immortal, you breathe and meditate to absorb spiritual energy and use your own body as a furnace to create the true elixir of immortality: the Golden Core.

192
00:13:32,880 --> 00:13:35,610
The realms of the first step of cultivation are:

193
00:13:35,400 --> 00:13:37,010
Qi Condensation,

194
00:13:37,240 --> 00:13:38,530
Foundation Establishment,

195
00:13:38,440 --> 00:13:39,970
Core Formation,

196
00:13:39,960 --> 00:13:41,330
Nascent Soul,

197
00:13:41,360 --> 00:13:42,610
Soul Formation,

198
00:13:42,520 --> 00:13:43,810
Soul Transformation,

199
00:13:43,720 --> 00:13:45,960
and Ascendant.

200
00:13:35,400 --> 00:13:45,970
Note: Refer to the cultivation level cheat sheet if needed.

201
00:13:46,840 --> 00:13:48,890
Let's start with the chants for the

202
00:13:48,680 --> 00:13:50,850
first 3 layers of Qi Condensation.

203
00:13:57,520 --> 00:13:59,360
Focus on your breathing !

204
00:14:02,040 --> 00:14:05,210
10 hours inside the bead is only 1 hour outside.

205
00:14:05,270 --> 00:14:08,440
Time in the Heaven Defying Space flows 10 times faster.

206
00:14:08,480 --> 00:14:10,840
This will buy your mortal body

207
00:14:10,600 --> 00:14:12,760
more time to cultivate.

208
00:14:15,200 --> 00:14:17,770
6 months later

209
00:14:17,400 --> 00:14:21,130
Senior Brother Liu has been preparing the Sect Competition

210
00:14:21,040 --> 00:14:23,010
so he doesn't have time to harass us anymore.

211
00:14:22,880 --> 00:14:26,160
The Xuan Dao Sect pretends to be friendly

212
00:14:25,920 --> 00:14:28,080
but they’ve always been our rivals.

213
00:14:28,440 --> 00:14:30,560
In the last few competitions,

214
00:14:30,320 --> 00:14:31,960
they won every match.

215
00:14:31,720 --> 00:14:33,440
We must be prepared.

216
00:14:37,040 --> 00:14:39,720
The competition with the Xuan Dao Sect is coming.

217
00:14:39,920 --> 00:14:43,000
Elder Sun will select one of you

218
00:14:42,760 --> 00:14:44,880
to become an inner disciple.

219
00:14:45,400 --> 00:14:46,440
Me ! Pick me !

220
00:14:46,760 --> 00:14:47,970
Choose me !

221
00:14:51,520 --> 00:14:53,320
Choose me !

222
00:14:54,880 --> 00:14:55,920
Me ! Me !

223
00:14:59,760 --> 00:15:00,880
Wang Lin,

224
00:15:01,080 --> 00:15:02,520
although you lack talent,

225
00:15:02,800 --> 00:15:04,920
your perseverance is exceptional.

226
00:15:05,320 --> 00:15:07,480
Will you become my disciple ?

227
00:15:09,360 --> 00:15:10,730
Why him !?

228
00:15:10,480 --> 00:15:12,160
Why choose him ?

229
00:15:12,240 --> 00:15:14,800
Whether it's talent, diligence or seniority,

230
00:15:14,560 --> 00:15:16,200
he's not qualified !

231
00:15:16,840 --> 00:15:18,450
What are you staring at ?

232
00:15:19,560 --> 00:15:20,480
Master.

233
00:15:22,400 --> 00:15:26,520
This pill and bag of holding are gifts for you, my disciple.

234
00:15:26,760 --> 00:15:30,160
It’s the tradition of the Heng Yue Sect.

235
00:15:39,960 --> 00:15:41,200
Move along,

236
00:15:40,960 --> 00:15:42,160
let's go back to work.

237
00:15:41,920 --> 00:15:43,960
Back to being lowly outer disciples...

238
00:15:49,520 --> 00:15:50,810
Senior Situ,

239
00:15:50,680 --> 00:15:51,890
I did it !

240
00:15:54,160 --> 00:15:56,450
Wang Lin
Heng Yue Sect disciple
1st layer of Qi Condensation

241
00:15:54,400 --> 00:15:56,610
I've mastered the Attraction technique !

242
00:15:56,640 --> 00:15:58,280
Don't get cocky.

243
00:15:58,640 --> 00:16:01,330
After cultivating in the Heaven Defying Bead for so long,

244
00:16:01,120 --> 00:16:04,250
you’ve only barely reached the 1st layer of Qi Condensation.

245
00:16:04,120 --> 00:16:06,410
Only your Attraction technique

246
00:16:06,280 --> 00:16:07,370
is passable.

247
00:16:36,840 --> 00:16:41,770
Note: 1 jin = 500g

248
00:16:36,840 --> 00:16:39,720
Senior Brother Liu, we agreed on 100 jin of firewood.

249
00:16:39,680 --> 00:16:41,770
But now you’ve raised it to 1000 jin !

250
00:16:41,600 --> 00:16:44,000
I, Zhang Hu, have bribed you well over these years.

251
00:16:43,760 --> 00:16:45,480
Are you really trying to expel me !?

252
00:16:46,320 --> 00:16:49,560
At least 30% of the wood you chop is water.

253
00:16:49,720 --> 00:16:51,490
You’re slandering me !

254
00:16:51,520 --> 00:16:52,760
Is it because

255
00:16:52,520 --> 00:16:54,610
I saw Zhao Fugui gift you a talisman ?

256
00:16:54,440 --> 00:16:57,360
Fine ! I’ll ask the Sect Leader about it !

257
00:16:58,240 --> 00:16:59,560
Zhang Hu,

258
00:16:59,320 --> 00:17:01,040
you forced me to do this !

259
00:17:08,000 --> 00:17:12,360
Stupid mortal, do you think you’ll live to see the Sect Leader ?

260
00:17:27,720 --> 00:17:30,280
You already learned the Attraction technique ?

261
00:17:30,600 --> 00:17:33,080
We're disciples of the same sect so don’t go too far !

262
00:17:33,360 --> 00:17:35,520
Are you lecturing me !?

263
00:17:35,960 --> 00:17:37,450
Wang Lin, watch out !

264
00:17:43,960 --> 00:17:45,800
Today is the day you die !

265
00:18:10,480 --> 00:18:12,000
You humiliated and bullied me,

266
00:18:11,800 --> 00:18:13,770
now you're trying to kill a disciple.

267
00:18:13,720 --> 00:18:15,200
You must be punished !

268
00:18:22,400 --> 00:18:26,800
You stupid ant, I’ll kill you !

269
00:18:55,380 --> 00:20:57,580
In the novel, Wang Lin returns home after failing the test. He then leaves during the night after writing a farewell letter to his parents and he tries to go back to the sect by himself. He then falls off a cliff and gets swallowed by the wind inside the cave where he finds the Heaven Defying Bead inside the stomach of a dead bird he was eating to survive. The suction force of the wind and his broken arm prevent him from escaping and he ends up staying there for multiple days. The whole part was cut but the consequences of it are still here with the characters thinking he attempted to kill himself.

It is important to understand that by soaking the Heaven Defying Bead in water, it absorbed spiritual energy of the water element and upgraded, thus allowing Wang Lin to cultivate inside it with the time acceleration.
The 5 elements of chinese feng shui are water, earth, fire, metal and wood. After seeing the bead absorb one element, Wang Lin guesses that he needs to complete all 5 to unlock the true power of the Heaven Defying Bead.

Spirit Roots were mentionned in the first 2 episodes, think of them as someone's potential for cultivation. They also have properties of the 5 elements.

This is also a good time to learn the different ranks of sect members. There might be variations but the most common hierarchy is this one :
Ancestor > Sect Leader > core disciple > Elder > inner disciple > outer disciple
There are some sects like here in Heng Yue where outer disciples are mortals but in better sects the outer disciples will be cultivators of low level.

